  "description": "Upgraded fun for town or trail. Equipped for city use with fenders, rack and more, we've use a powerful Bosch drive unit and large battery, paired with a reliable aluminium full-suspension frame. Fun mixed wheel setup for dodging rocks or potholes and kit that will give you miles of riding fun.\n\nFun for the trail or the town. The ETMO 500 PRO EQ features an upgraded, powerful Bosch CX 120 Nm drive system and a high-capacity 800 Wh battery, paired with our reliable aluminium full-suspension frame. It's ready to go off-road, but it's fully equipped with fenders, lights and rack for urban use. We've used SR Suntour suspension units to deliver comfort and performance, while the reliable shifts of the Shimano drivetrain and powerful SRAM brakes will keep things under control. Add in fun but planted handling thanks to a mixed wheel size setup and our well-proven geometry concept, and you're ready to ride.\n\nA quality e-MTB means more runs, more fun, and more time just getting out there. This is why we’ve created the MERIDA ETMO, our most price-focussed Bosch-powered e-MTB ever. We’ve used all our aluminium frame design and manufacturing know-how to create a durable frame that takes inspiration from the award-winning long-travel eONE-EIGHTY, but in an extra versatile and affordable package. The ETMO uses 160 mm of travel* at either end and mixed wheel sizes, so it’s fun and fast on any terrain, with handling that’ll bring a smile to the face of experienced riders and fresh faces alike. We've backed this up with our lifetime frame warranty, too.\n\nWith the proven and trusted power of Bosch pedal assistance, the ETMO offers battery and drive unit options for every need and wallet, with 540, 600 or 800 Wh internal batteries and the choice of powerful CX or high-value PX drive units depending on the model. We also have EQ models that come fully equipped with fenders, lights, a kickstand and a rear rack for urban SUV use, plus PRO models that have upgraded drive unit and battery specs.\n\n*Some models come with 140 mm fork and and 143 mm rear travel.",
